{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nmPgjw13PP1794566814.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平下周到深圳出席亞太經合組織(APEC)峰會。外交部表示，期待達成《深圳宣言》。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧說：「下周APEC第三十三次領導人非正式會議，將在深圳拉開帷幕，我們期待各方進一步凝聚共識，達成《領導人深圳宣言》，在貿易、互聯互通、數字經濟和人工智能(AI)等重要領域取得更多的務實成果，為亞太乃至全球繁榮增長注入強勁動力。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.APEC-1830-1_CLEAN_20261113_182645.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266Rs969sOey1794566824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今年會議主題是『建設亞太共同體，促進共同繁榮』，習近平主持會議並發表講話。而APEC工商領導人峰會下周二和周三舉行，習近平亦會出席開幕式並作主旨演講。會議期間，習近平亦為各經濟體領導人或代表舉行歡迎宴會，並同外國領導人舉行雙邊會晤。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:27.096593+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T02:51:34.063802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:49.004849+00:00","content_hash":"537b3ecc4655a02851ecfd8c29f247a15ae9646a802604a3fb909ab4a6ed5cfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:27.096593+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}